Z||000004||Stage-2GT||08-12-2001||01:43 PM||||   Ed has a point. Meaningless words over the internet are no reason to cast volatile threats that will never materialize. Let it go. So you don't like Ed, big deal, avoid his threads and his replies. I havelearned a lot while watching the previous posts go off track. Just try to disengage yourselves when those you don't like appear. No one here will ever meet in mutual combat in the real, so it's senseless. Just my 2 cents, but man this place is getting weird. Perhaps cliff should start another forum, the "Forum Of The Hated" then each year at regional events we can have battles to settle all the scores. I think that would be fun!<P>S2GT <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000005||EdsB52||08-12-2001||03:00 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by TRiAD:<BR><B>Ed, just for clarification, I don't see ME in your post. <P>This is about other people, right?<P>Just checking...<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>Exactly TRiAD, I wrote:<P>"Me and the other party have apparently made amends and I am not directing this thread at him."<P>I know it's an arduous read, but it's in there toward the top. Well put Stage2-GT, I just want to get on to other subjects. I typed for 9 hours last night.||||reg||12
Z||000006||Mach10||08-12-2001||03:33 PM||||I'm impressed. An intelligent argument. <P>Comment cheerfully withdrawn. No broken joints for anyone!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> <P>Oh, and I'm 5"9. I mis-typed. I'm not fat, I'm of medium build. I work out, and lead an active lifestyle. Used to speed-swim. I was shorter, but about the same weight before I quit.<P>On the other hand, I find it amusing that you spent 9 hours typing responses... Then again, that's all I do at work, waiting for calls. BUT, I only do it for 7. I do other stuff on my breaks  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I'll stand down now. I can't rebutt your argument. Touche. Ippom. Call it what you want. Back to the Car we love, Okie?<P>Look forward to debating you in the future. Ta!||||reg||10
